Privacy-policy snapshots live here as `{YYYY-MM-DD}.blade.php` files.

Each file is a frozen copy of the privacy/android Blade view at the time
of an amendment. They serve at `/privacy/android/history/{date}`. When
the live policy at `/privacy/android` changes the operator publishes a
new snapshot here using the date of the change.

Append-only — old snapshots must NEVER be edited because they back
prior consent claims.
